GNU General Public License, version 3 or later: `LICENSE`. `lib/` and `base/` also link and carry FreeRTOS, lwIP, LVGL and FatFs under their own
licences: the texts are in `licenses/`, and `NOTICE` names them, the source commit and the origin of the interface headers.
